Valks are bad spellcasters yes, the third worst after cavemen and 
barbarians. I was going to say Finger of Death was probably out of their 
league, but I thought I'd test it in wizard mode. It turns out, at level 
30, with basic (max) Attack skill, maxed wisdom, a +5 helm of brilliance 
and a robe, a human valkyrie can in fact cast FoD 43% of the time. Just 
barely useful, I suppose. However, yhey can cast lesser spells with a 
decent chance of success without the need for quite that many modifiers, 
and they get a bonus with Cone of Cold.

